# The one identity whose pull request may change a caller's .github/gates.lock,
# one `<login> <numeric user id>` per line. run/lock.sh reads this file from
# gates main, never from the pull request it is judging.
#
# Empty until the bump App is registered: a login alone binds to whoever first
# registers an App of that name, so the numeric id is part of the binding, and
# with no line here every lock change is refused.
